      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An an event runner who would like to record events, this would be incredibly helpful. I run music events and would like to record a camera feed and audio streamed into the world without capturing conversations or disruptive avatar sounds.\n\nI've experimented with a variety of workarounds for this, none of which are ideal and add a lot of management overhead while I'm trying to also coordinate and moderate an event with multiple performers.\n\nIdeally we'd be able to select which audio types (each we have a volume slider for) get passed through to Spout.\n\nI can envision this being useful for streamers and other creators as well. Such as being able to exclude World Audio to avoid copyright audio being recorded.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
