      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Does spout have audio now? Last time I checked its a technology that is for video, like a shared video texture. \n\nThe general idea of being able to somehow get a differently configured audio out of vrchat is a good idea, I just think it's not going to invoke the SPOUT2 standard.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-05T15:15:34.422Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be real nice if SPOUT Capture allowed us to select what audio to pass through to spout. \n\nThe game already allows us to turn down or mute World Volume and Voice Volumes. \n\nIf we could pass this on to spout it be huge. \n\nIf this already exists, apologies! I used search and could not find this.\n\nThis would make recording events for Club Worlds so much easier. We currently have to user a separate account and a separate machine if we still want to interact with people and organize during.",
